    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoswa yalachilisia abaReubeni nabaGadi nabeinusu yoluyia lwaManase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yoswa nalanga abaReubeni nabaGadi nabeinusu yoluyia lwaManase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nababoolela mbu Inywe muusiye kosi aka Musa omusumba w yamulachilisia, nimuhulila amakhuwa kanje mukosi aka ndamulakanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimwayeebala abaana beenywe tsindaalo tsino tsinyinji okhuula olwa leelo ta; ne mwalindilenje aka mwalachilisibwa khwilako liOMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe uhuluusiye abaana beenywe, shinga olwa yababoolela; kho bulaano shiukhane, mutsie ebunango weenywe, khushialo eshili eshieenywe, eshia Musa omusumba wOMWAMI yamuheelesia injelekha weYorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula mbu murekhwo omwoyo okhukhola akalachilisibwa nakamalako aka Musa omusumba wOMWAMI yamulaka, mbu okhuheela OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe, nokhuchenda khunjilatsie tsiosi; okhukhola akamalakoke, nokhumuhandakhwo, nokhumukhalabanila nomwoyo kwosi neshiimo shiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yoswa nabasabila ikhabi nabaseebula; nabo nibatsia ebunango wabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Musa yali niyaheelesia inusu yoluyia lwaManase obulaame muBashani; ne inusu yindi yoluyia tsana, Yoswa yabaheelesia hakari wabaana babwe injelekha weYorodani mumbo. Khandi olwa Yoswa yabaseebula batsie ingo, yabasabila ikhabi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nasungana ninabo, naboola mbu Kalushile mungo tsieenywe nimuli nobuyinda obunji nemiruko eminji, netsifeetsa, netsitsahaabu, nemikasa, nebibia, netsingubo tsinyinji muno; kabane nabaana beenywe ebiyaayilwe mubasuku beenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abaana baReubeni nabaana baGadi neinusu yoluyia lwaManase nibeenyokha, nibarula mubaana baIsiraeli, okhurula eShiilo, elili mushialo shiaKanaani, mbu batsie mushialo shiaGileadi, khushialo shiabwe abeene, eshia bali nibalia, lilako liOMWAMI mumunwa kwaMusa shinga olwa liali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eshimalilo shiemisango haYorodani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa boola mumbali tsienaYorodani mushialo shiaKanaani, abaana baReubeni nabaana baGadi neinusu yoluyia lwaManase boombakhayo eshimalilo shiemisango haYorodani, eshikhongo muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baIsiraeli nibaboolelwa mbu Lole, abaana baReubeni nabaana baGadi neinusu yoluyia lwaManase boombaashe eshimalilo khulwakho Iweshialo shiaKanaani, mumbali tsienaYorodani, khulubeka oluli lwabaana baIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa abaana baIsiraeli bahulilakhwo, omukhung'aano kwosi kwabaana baIsiraeli bakhung'aana eShiilo, okhutikulukha okhubaseera lihe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baIsiraeli nibaruma Finehasi waEleazari omukuhani ewabaana baReubeni nabaana baGadi neinusu yoluyia lwaManase, mushialo shiaGileadi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibamuruma nende abakhulundu ekhumi, mulala okhurula mubuli luyia lwalsiraeli, buli mulala nali omukhulundu weshili-bwa shilala mutsimbia tsiaIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niboola ewabaana baReubeni, newabaana baGadi, newainusu yoluyia lwaManase, mushialo shiaGileadi, nibasungana ninabo, bari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abomukhung'aano kwOMWAMI kwosi bareeba mbu Nobukhayi shiina buno obwa mukholile nimufukula Nyasaye waIsiraeli, nimushiukhana leelo oburalonda khuMWAMI ta, nimwiyumbashila eshimalilo, nimukholela OMWAMI induli inyanga yino? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obumayaanu obwali ePeori shibukhuhelile, obwa khushili okhwisiiyakhwo okhuula elwa leelo, kata olwa linyasio lioluumbe lieetsela omukhung'aano kwOMWAMI? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho mwenya okhushiukhana leelo oburalonda khuMWAMI ta? Nimuba nimukholela OMWAMI induli leelo, mukamba alatiililwa omukhung'aano kwosi kwaIsiraeli oburima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa bulaano, eshialo eshili eshieenywe nishiba nishili eshiomusilo, kho mwambushe mwinjile mushialo eshili shiOMWAMI, omwa eshimenyo shiOMWAMI shibeetsanga, mube nebieenywe hakari weefwe. Habula murakholela OMWAMI induli, kata okhuchila ifwe nikhukwa abeinduli, nimwiyumbashila eshimalilo eshirali eshimalilo shiene shiOMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhani waZera shiyakhola akobukhayi mwikhuwa lieshindu eshiahulilwa okhumalilanwa, mana oburima nibukwila omukhung'aano kwosi kwaIsiraeli? Kata omundu oyo shiyafwila yenyene mubumayaanubwe ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abaana baReubeni nabaana baGadi neinusu yoluyia lwaManase nibakalusia, nibasunjila abeemilisi bebilibwa biaIsiraeli bari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabanyasaye! OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabanyasaye! Ye amanyile, khandi Isiraeli balamanya. Niyiba niyibeele induli, kata nibuba nibubeele obukhayi, okhufukula OMWAMI, kho orakhuhonokosia leelo ta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khulwa okhwiyumbashila eshimalilo nokhushiukhana oburalonda khuMWAMI ta; nikhuba nikhukholile mbu khumalilenjekhwo emisango emisambe, kata emisango chieimele, kata emisango chiokhwishia, OMWAMI omwene akhubanze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa khukholile nikhumanyile, nikhuriitsanga mbu haundi mundaalo etsiitsa, abaana beenywe bakhareeba abaana beefwe bari Inywe mulikhwo nelikhuwa khuMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba OMWAMI yakhola Yorodani kube olwakho hakari weefwe nineenyu, inywe abaana baReubeni nabaana baGadi; shimulikhwo nomukabo kwosi muMWAMI ta. Nilwo olwa abaana beenywe bakhanyala okhuchila abaana beefwe nibalekha okhuriitsanga OMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne niko akachila nikhusunga mbu Chende khwikasie okhwiyumbashila eshimalilo; ne khulwa emisango emisambe ta, kata khulwa emisango chindi tawe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula mbu shibe eshiobuloli hakari weefwe nineenyu, khandi hakari wetsinzibulo etsiitsa munyuma weefwe, mbu khukholenje obukhalabani bwOMWAMI imbeliwe nemisango chieefwe emisambe, nemisango chieefwe chindi, khandi nemisango chieefwe chiokhwishia; mbu abaana beenywe baleshe okhusunjila abaana beefwe mundaalo etsiitsa mbu Shimulikhwo nomukabo kwosi muMWAMI ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne niko akachila nikhupaara mbu Nibaba nibakhakhusunjila bario, kata if w e kata abeetsukhulu beefwe, mundaalo etsiitsa, kho khwakhakalusia mbu Lole omufwano kweshimalilo shiOMWAMI, okwa abakuuka beefwe bakhola, ne khulwa emisango emisambe ta, kata khulwa emisango chindi tawe; habula nokwobuloli hakari weefwe nineenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shikakhanyalikha nzhatuutu ta, ifwe okhukholela OMWAMI induli, kata okhushiukhana inyanga yino oburalonda khuMWAMI ta, nokhuumbakha eshimalilo khulwa emisango emisambe, nemisango chieimele, nemisango chindi, eshirali eshimalilo shiemisango shiOMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe, eshili imbeli weshimenyoshie ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
